# Mac 3 (Backend A) - Phase 2 Extension C: only the edge (Mac 2, 10.7.7.100) may reach port 3001.
# Loaded into the pf sub-anchor com.apple/cn, which macOS's /etc/pf.conf already reads; pf.conf is never edited.
#   on:   sudo pfctl -a com.apple/cn -f pf-mac3.rules && sudo pfctl -E      (note the Token it prints)
#   off:  sudo pfctl -a com.apple/cn -F all && sudo pfctl -X <Token>         (pf back to its previous state)
pass in quick on lo0 all
pass in quick proto tcp from 10.7.7.100 to any port 3001
block drop in quick proto tcp from any to any port 3001
